review_content = "I work as a driver and pass this cafe often while doing my work. I used to enjoy stopping by for a quick drink every once in a while, and the workers were always kind to me. Now, they only offer a crappy machine that doesn't even get my order right. I'll stop somewhere else next time I want a drink.

